  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "You ever have one of those days where you have plans, real confirmed plans, but deep down you're secretly hoping they get canceled? That was me last Friday. I had dinner plans with a couple of friends. I like them, I really do, but it had been a long week. I was tired, the weather was bad, and honestly, my couch was calling. I kept checking my phone all afternoon half hoping someone would text, \"Hey, should we reschedule?\" And then it happened, one of them sent the message, \"Hey, something came up. Can we do it another day?\" I swear I smiled like I'd just won the lottery. I texted back, \"No worries at all,\" pretending to be disappointed but I was already in sweatpants. Ten minutes later, I was eating leftovers watching a movie I'd already seen and feeling zero guilt about it.",
      "start_time": 0.14,
      "end_time": 54.139,
